# Arrows Play release record: versionCode 20 (versionName 1.0.0), not yet built.
# status: candidate
# The vc19 set unchanged. vc20 exists for one native fix: plugins/withLargeScreens.js re-checks the phone portrait lock in
# MainActivity.onConfigurationChanged, so a fold that changes size without recreating the activity keeps phones portrait
# (R11-9, emulator-checked 2026-10-29). vc19 (da71d6d) lacks it and is superseded.
# Shell use: set -a; . release/vc20.env; set +a
# Checked by src/__tests__/releaseRecord.test.ts. History: never edit a shipped record; add vc<N>.env.
# consent: EXPO_PUBLIC_CONSENT_GATE=1. Google UMP runs before AdMob starts and fails closed: no ad until UMP resolves, none after a refusal. Needs the AdMob GDPR message published first, or EEA players get no ads.
